  "id": "USN-8672-1",
  "summary": "sssd vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that the SSSD PAM responder may crash if a physically\nproximate attacker manipulates a smartcard or Yubikey. Non-malicious\nphysically proximate users may not be able to log in depending upon the\ndetails of their legitimate smartcard or Yubikey.",
